<LE>Source: Paul Cotton, following RTM meeting

<LE>Description:

<P>
<REFERENCE>(olb_taxonomy\FULL),
<REFERENCE>(olb_noncore_taxonomy_table\FULL), needs to be modified to
describe all of the optional features of SQLJ.  In partiular, the
following items could be made into optional subfeatures:

<LIST>(UNNUMBERED)

<LE><REFERENCE>(olb_sqljconc_calls\FULL), the Note that says "Support for
calls to stored procedures and functions is not required for conformance
to Core SQLJ."

<P>
