"Support for <LB>function clause> is not required for conformance to Core
SQLJ."

<LE><REFERENCE>(olb_sqljconc_execctrl\FULL), the note that says "Runtime
support of the above ExecutionContext Java fields, if set to anything
other than their default values, is not part of Core SQLJ."

<P>
